  description: "[ Pendulum Effect ] \nOnce per turn: You can target 1 other card
    in a Pendulum Zone; this card's Pendulum Scale becomes equal to that card's,
    until the end of this turn.\n\n[ Monster Effect ] \nWhile you have 2 cards in
    your Pendulum Zones with the same Pendulum Scale, this card gains ATK and DEF
    equal to the Pendulum Scale x 100, and can attack your opponent directly. If
    this card inflicts battle damage to your opponent by a direct attack: Destroy
    all cards in the Pendulum Zones."
